Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.12,0:03:22.00,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,500,4500,5600)\pos(653.755,435.055)}Episode 49\N\N\N\N\NLiú Bèi Enters the Riverlands
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.22,0:03:31.79,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In the 16th year of the Jian'an era (211 CE),
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.66,0:03:34.19,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Liu Zhang, the Lord of Yi Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.33,0:03:39.76,Thinking,,0,0,0,,invited Liu Bei to enter the Riverlands with troops to help him defend against Zhang Lu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.57,0:03:45.80,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei's army of fifty thousand was strictly disciplined along the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.04,0:03:50.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,making no offense to the people, which gained the hearts of the Western Riverlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.75,0:03:56.98,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Liu Zhang, hearing the reports, specially went to Fucheng from Chengdu,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.15,0:04:02.72,Thinking,,0,0,0,,in order to personally welcome Liu Bei and talk about their fraternal bond of kinship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.93,0:04:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.78,0:04:11.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(975.297,505.06)}Liú Zhāng\NStyled: Jìyù
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.23,0:04:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Xuande is my kin. How can he take my estate?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.27,0:04:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, this trip to Fucheng is like entering \Na forest of swords. You will be harmed by Liu Bei!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.58,0:04:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not go, my Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.78,0:04:25.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(301.842,475.06)}Huáng Quán\NStyled: Gōnghéng
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.71,0:04:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been in service for many years. \NI cannot bear to see my Lord fall for another's ruse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.25,0:04:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Please reconsider, my Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.26,0:04:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My mind is set. No need to say more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.49,0:04:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, my Lord, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.83,0:04:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.10,0:04:56.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(979.103,526.897)}Zhāng Sōng\NStyled: \NYǒngnián
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.01,0:04:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Indecision at this critical juncture \Nis only harmful to sire's enterprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.31,0:05:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord! My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.12,0:05:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not go, my Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.29,0:05:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Exit the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.16,0:05:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.86,0:05:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord! My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.23,0:05:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!\NStop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.70,0:05:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.87,0:05:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sire!\N-What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.00,0:05:33.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It's Attendant Official Wang Lei. He said that if sire refuses to listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.04,0:05:35.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,he will cut the plain silk and fall to his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.35,0:05:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me the remonstration.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.50,0:05:48.09,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}I, your official, Attendant Wang Lei of Yi Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.09,0:05:49.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}weep blood and plea:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.69,0:05:51.98,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}"A bitter medicine cures the disease,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.36,0:05:55.44,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"and honest advice, though unpleasant to hear, is beneficial."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.28,0:06:03.88,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Qū Yuán（屈原）: Famous poet and politician of the state of Chǔ who was exiled and driven to suicide. Associated with the origin of the Duānwǔ Festival AKA. Dragon Boat Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.24,0:06:01.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}In the past, King Huai of Chu did not heed Qu Yuan's words, thus doomed Chu to the Qin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.82,0:06:05.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Today, my Lord credulously believes in Zhang Song, and desires to let Liu Bei in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.68,0:06:07.68,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}I fear that there will be no return!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.20,0:06:11.26,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If Zhang Song is executed, and Liu Bei be rejected,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.26,0:06:15.78,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The old and young of Shu shall rejoice, and my Lord's estate shall prosper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.12,0:06:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.46,0:06:23.82,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(995.782,484.091)}Wáng Lěi
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.39,0:06:24.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I invite Liu Xuande to defend against Zhang Lu,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.10,0:06:26.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and to protect the people of the Riverlands and the estate of the forefathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.83,0:06:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you disturb the people's hearts and insult me repeatedly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.57,0:06:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking? Who gave you the nerve!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.91,0:06:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.91,0:06:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.36,0:06:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, owing to Wang Lei's lifetime service to his master,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.08,0:07:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I earnestly hope that he will be buried with honors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.91,0:07:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This trip to Fucheng is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.18,0:07:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take good care of this, Aide-de-Camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.69,0:07:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.39,0:07:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Exit the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.40,0:08:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-It is just up ahead,\N-My lord, we are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.64,0:08:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, Imperial Uncle Liu is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.71,0:08:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.86,0:08:31.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I am indebted to Elder Brother's arrival. The journey must've been arduous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.21,0:08:33.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Please accept my respects.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:39.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,With the passes and mountains obstructing and the military matters interfering,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.82,0:08:40.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(970.667,508.727)}Liú Bèi\NStyled: \NXuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.60,0:08:42.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,we brothers have not had the chance to meet each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.90,0:08:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's meeting has greatly comforted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.34,0:08:48.13,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320.826,484.473)}Páng Tǒng \NStyled: Shìyuán
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.18,0:08:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Strategist Pang Tong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.74,0:08:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Also known as {\i1}Fengchu.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.96,0:09:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,These are my staff, civil and military.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.78,0:09:07.53,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(451.2,475.2)}Lěng Bāo
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.83,0:09:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother Xuande, please let us enter the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.78,0:09:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.93,0:09:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Please look, Imperial Elder Brother, this is the Fu Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:22.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(283.273,519.485)}Fǎ Zhèng\NStyled: Xiàozhí
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, during today's banquet, what are your thoughts on Liu Jiyu's character?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.73,0:09:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiyu is an honest man, and I should treat him sincerely as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.46,0:10:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Though Jiyu is kind, at his side, Zhang Ren, Liu Gui, and other generals are resentful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.28,0:10:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Following my plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.68,0:10:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}tomorrow, my Lord shall set up a banquet to thank Jiyu,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.20,0:10:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}we may lay a hundred armed men in ambush outside the tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.10,0:10:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}The moment sire throws down the cup,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.44,0:10:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}we will kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Then, march directly to Chengdu and seize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.98,0:10:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}This way, without pulling a single blade out of its scabbard,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.00,0:10:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}and without nocking a single arrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.66,0:10:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,the Western Riverland can be taken in one fell swoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.82,0:10:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Delay for too long,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}and our chances will become less certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.14,0:10:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Jiyu has treated me with kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.28,0:10:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}How can I do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.72,0:10:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Besides, I have just arrived in Shu. Should I do so,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.45,0:10:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}man and Heaven alike will be angered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.94,0:10:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}This plan of yours is not fit for even hegemons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.52,0:11:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Esteemed Sire, we do not do this for ourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}and we have no animosities against Liu Jiyu;
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.84,0:11:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}we are simply following the mandate of Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.24,0:11:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Sire, you have traveled far through the mountains, and driven the troops to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.80,0:11:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Advance, and there is success. \NWithdraw, and there will be no benefits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.04,0:11:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Should this be delayed for a moment's clemency,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.52,0:11:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}if our plans are revealed, others may conspire to defeat us instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.09,0:11:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}It is better to catch him off guard while we have \Nthe advantage, and solidify our great undertaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.18,0:11:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}This is the utmost stratagem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.97,0:11:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, Xiaozhi's words are correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.54,0:11:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that my Lord reconsiders and does not miss this great opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.41,0:11:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Without first establishing grace and trust, a plan must not be rushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.42,0:11:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no need to discuss this further. Two sirs may go and rest early.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.13,0:11:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.57,0:12:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Huang Quan and Wang Lei were suspecting out of paranoia,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.51,0:12:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,not at all knowing what kind of person Liu Bei, my Elder Brother in kin, is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.01,0:12:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,With such a compassionate gentleman coming to help,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.08,0:12:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,what are Cao Cao and Zhang Lu to worry about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.49,0:12:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for Aide-de-Camp Zhang's dutiful care, wouldn't I be at a loss?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.60,0:12:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.90,0:12:35.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,rejoicing now could be too early.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.98,0:12:34.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(505.018,133.636)}Zhāng Rèn
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.12,0:12:37.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Liu Bei harbors rigidity in softness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.06,0:12:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,His true intentions are not yet known, and he must be watched.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.11,0:12:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,During the banquet, I saw you people appear suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.98,0:12:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so paranoid?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.89,0:12:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My elder brother is clearly a sincere gentleman. How can he have second thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.96,0:13:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he does, what can his paltry couple thousand troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.72,0:13:05.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,do to my men of hundreds of thousands?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.70,0:13:10.42,Note (Potential style?),NTP,0,0,0,,1 {\i1}liǎng{\i0} ≈ 14g during the Three Kingdoms Era
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.70,0:13:10.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Get five hundred {\i1}liang{\i0} of gold, send it to Chengdu,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.42,0:13:13.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and gift it to Aide-de-Camp Zhang to reward his accomplishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.37,0:13:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:30.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sire insisted on inviting Liu Bei to enter the Riverlands, despite objections.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.30,0:13:32.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Today, he welcomed Liu Bei personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.66,0:13:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear that sire will eventually be overtaken by Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.80,0:13:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not see Liu Bei as a corrupt man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.08,0:13:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But I fear that Pang Tong and Wei Yan may harbor wicked intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.04,0:13:52.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Liu Bei has invited sire to his camp for a banquet. I fear that the odds are against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.55,0:13:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Should anything happen...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:13:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Better be broken jade than intact tile.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.56,0:14:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Virtuous Younger Brother, please.\N-Benevolent Elder Brother, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.51,0:14:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.89,0:14:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.00,0:14:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Virtuous Younger Brother, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.72,0:15:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sirs and Generals, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.02,0:15:12.56,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(313.794,488.515)}Wèi Yán\NStyled: Wéncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.09,0:15:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, Sire and Lord Liu of Yi Province gather at this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.23,0:15:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a great privilege for me, Wei Yan, to be present.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I am willing to dance with my sword for our lords' enjoyment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.48,0:15:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Virtuous Younger Brother, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.23,0:15:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Virtuous Younger Brother, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.98,0:16:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.46,0:16:13.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(323.345,496.515)}Huáng Zhōng\NStyled: Hànshēng
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.78,0:16:39.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sword dances should be done in pairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.74,0:16:43.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I, Zhang Ren, am willing to dance together with General Wei to liven the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.62,0:16:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.66,0:17:04.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I, Liu Feng, am willing to dance together with Generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:07.13,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,We are willing to make a group dance for all Lords' entertainment!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.28,0:17:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Virtuous Younger Brother, where are you going?\NElder Brother, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.59,0:17:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Drop your swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.44,0:17:34.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We brothers are meant to gather in merriment and kinship, this is not a Hongmen Banquet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.16,0:17:34.92,Note (Potential style?),NTP,0,0,0,,Hóngmén Banquet （鸿门宴）: A plot by Xiàng Yǔ, the Hegemon of Western Chǔ, to assassinate Liú Bāng, by inviting him to a banquet and killing him there with a fake sword dance in 206 BCE.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.50,0:17:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Who ordered you to make sword dances?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.37,0:17:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever doesn't drop his sword will be executed at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.79,0:17:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you drop your sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.36,0:18:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand down, all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.50,0:18:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Remove your swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.12,0:18:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We brothers are of the same clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.02,0:18:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Our discussions need not to give good sirs reason to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.33,0:18:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.41,0:18:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please drink up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.75,0:19:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, rest assured. If I, Liu Bei, harbor any intention to harm my younger brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,then Heavenly principles do not tolerate me, and my crimes deserve death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.73,0:19:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sirs, if you trust me, Liu Bei, then please drink up this cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.68,0:19:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.92,0:19:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, Zhang Lu's army is coming to Jiameng Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.25,0:19:37.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Worry not, Virtuous Younger Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.26,0:19:41.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Elder Brother is here to share your worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.43,0:19:46.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, I will lead troops to Jiameng Pass, to defend against Zhang Lu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.82,0:19:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Virtuous Younger Brother, you only need to provide the supplies and be rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.91,0:19:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare not forget Elder Brother's benevolence for my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.42,0:20:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,668.6)}What can man do, if one denies Heaven's gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.29,0:20:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If it had not been for me, the situation at the banquet would certainly go out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.30,0:20:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ploy was truly inappropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.44,0:20:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire has led an army into the Riverlands,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.02,0:21:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and soon, Sun Quan will certainly want Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.14,0:21:04.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I did his to aid my Lord in deciding on the stratagem for the Riverlands,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.94,0:21:06.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and to not miss the great chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.35,0:21:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I naturally understand your earnest thoughts,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.38,0:21:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but why this urgency that could dishonor my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.29,0:21:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,In the future, refrain from these actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.33,0:21:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.40,0:21:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is the case, please rest, my Lord. I shall take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.54,0:21:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategist, please rest early.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.59,0:21:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei has led an army into the Riverlands,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.32,0:21:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and is now garrisoning Jiameng Pass to help Liu Zhang defend against Zhang Lu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.54,0:21:57.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I intend to take Jing Province back,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.66,0:21:59.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(312.582,471.636)}Sūn Quán\NStyled: Zhòngmóu
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.09,0:22:00.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,but Kongming and Guan Yu are stationed in Jīng Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.53,0:22:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-My sirs, what good plans do you have?\N-My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.61,0:22:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Xuande has long promised to return Jing Province after taking the Western Riverlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.80,0:22:16.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(319.369,480.151)}Lǔ Sù\NStyled: Zǐjìng
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.74,0:22:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I am afraid that going there to seize it now may be inappropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.32,0:22:27.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,State Mother, please do not mention to Marquis of Wu that I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.19,0:22:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.23,0:22:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.97,0:22:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei had traveled through tough terrain, it is difficult for him to turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.98,0:22:35.66,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320.655,481.242)}Gù Yōng\NStyled: Yuántàn
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.87,0:22:40.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lord, why not first send troops to block the river mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.80,0:22:43.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,cut Liu Bei's path of return,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.01,0:22:47.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and then command an army to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.16,0:22:49.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Would Jing-Xiang not be taken within one beat of a drum?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.95,0:22:52.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Who wants to harm my daughter's life?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.35,0:22:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.39,0:22:59.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You have assisted my son for many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.75,0:23:03.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How dare you have such an ill idea? You ought to be beheaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.70,0:23:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please quell your anger, State Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.57,0:23:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Please quell your anger, State Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.44,0:23:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Your younger sister was married to Liu Bei and is now in Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.54,0:23:19.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If you lead troops to attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.36,0:23:21.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,would your sister's life not be in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.50,0:23:22.76,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(294.836,349.745)}State Mother Wú
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.01,0:23:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.27,0:23:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You are in charge of the estate of your father and elder brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.79,0:23:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You hold the counties of Jiangdong, you are still not content?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.09,0:23:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Only thinking about besieging cities and taking land, not caring about familial affection at all. You...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.60,0:23:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, you are correct. I, your son, will comply.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.94,0:23:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I have only one daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.61,0:23:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Should something happen to her, this will not end!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.68,0:23:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you disperse?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.52,0:23:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, madam.\NYes, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.25,0:24:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you disperse? Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.01,0:24:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.51,0:24:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Zibu.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.65,0:24:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,With State Mother not allowing the use of troops, I believe another plan ought to be considered.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.06,0:24:34.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(316.8,502.933)}Zhāng Zhāo\NStyled: Zǐbù
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.49,0:24:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother's orders are hard to disobey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.50,0:24:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't be an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.50,0:24:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Men can be sent to pick Her Highness up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.60,0:24:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, what obstacles exist to stop the use of troops?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.84,0:25:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She is now the wife of Liu Bei. How can she return so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.18,0:25:09.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lord only needs to send a confidant with a couple soldiers to sneak into Jing Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.52,0:25:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,claiming that State Mother is gravely ill and wants to see her own daughter one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.10,0:25:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How could Her Highness not return immediately?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.30,0:25:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,A good idea, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.37,0:25:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,To curse State Mother as sickly seems improper.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.71,0:25:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The matters of state come first,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.11,0:25:38.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,not to mention that this plan can fulfill the love of mother and daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.22,0:25:41.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Is this improper?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.09,0:25:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Adou, Liu Bei's son, is now with Her Highness and can be brought over together.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.70,0:25:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, a letter can be sent to Liu Bei, urging him to return Jing Province for Adou.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.58,0:26:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei only has this one son, and he cherishes him like his own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.44,0:26:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He will be willing to give up land for his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.51,0:26:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, Jing Province will be returned without issue. Is it not good?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.62,0:26:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A brilliant plan indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.76,0:26:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Liu Bei is unwilling,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.13,0:26:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,there will be no more obstruction to use force.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.00,0:26:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.66,0:26:41.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(319.636,500.455)}Zhōu Shàn
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.24,0:26:50.92,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(293.818,443.182)}Jīng Province
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.62,0:26:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.53,0:27:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-Please hold.\N-I'm here to see Mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.26,0:27:16.50,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(319.855,330)}Lady Sūn
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.16,0:27:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.03,0:27:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lady, Zhou Shan is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.87,0:27:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring him here.\NYes, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.36,0:27:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.88,0:27:52.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You have come to Jing Province from afar. Surely this is for great importance?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.12,0:27:55.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My Lady, State Mother has suddenly fallen ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.78,0:27:58.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My Lady, going back now is not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.89,0:28:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Any hesitation, and it might be difficult to see State Mother one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.70,0:28:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother has always been healthy. How is she so ill?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.64,0:28:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that a man's fate can change in one day, \Nnot to mention that State Mother is advanced in age.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.81,0:28:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What illness does State Mother have?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.38,0:28:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I- I can't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.71,0:28:26.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I only hear that State Mother is quite ill, not being able to eat anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.62,0:28:30.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,She misses you, my Lady, talking about wanting to see you in her sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.83,0:28:35.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Here is Marquis of Wu's letter. Please read it, my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.88,0:28:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It has only been three years, yet mother has become so ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.71,0:28:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lady, there is no time to waste. Please get ready to depart.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.59,0:29:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle departed for the Western Riverlands, and all major affairs are administered by Strategos.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.43,0:29:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I must first report to Strategos before leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.00,0:29:20.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If Strategos says to wait for Imperial Uncle to return before going, would it not be too late?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.67,0:29:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaving without saying farewell, I fear that there will be obstacles on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.18,0:29:29.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My Lady, a fast boat is ready by the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.60,0:29:31.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Should my Lady depart immediately,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.65,0:29:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,my Lady would have exited Jing Province before any obstruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.69,0:29:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps this is the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.34,0:29:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother also keeps bringing up her grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.73,0:29:46.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Marquis of Wu urges my Lady to bring him too,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.95,0:29:48.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,so that State Mother may see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.10,0:29:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But if the Strategos hears of this...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.78,0:30:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,A grandmother seeing her grandson is my Lady's familial matter and human nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.91,0:30:03.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How can Strategos deny that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.82,0:30:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.32,0:30:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire is garrisoning Jiameng Pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.26,0:30:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,helping Liu Zhang to defend against Zhang Lu,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.74,0:30:21.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(259.418,230.819)}Zhūgě Liàng\NStyled:\N Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.17,0:30:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but, in reality, is winning the hearts of the local people,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.54,0:30:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,which is beneficial to the pacification of the Western Riverlands later.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.94,0:30:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.51,0:30:38.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Strategos, three men of Wu are witnessed to have arrived to the Mistress with a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.00,0:30:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, where are we going to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.86,0:30:55.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Today, we are not going to play. I'm bringing you to see grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.72,0:30:57.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Is grandmother far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.44,0:30:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.60,0:31:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why isn't Uncle Zhao going with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.38,0:31:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Uncle Zhao is busy with military work. He cannot go with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.15,0:31:09.56,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(304,470.4)}Ādǒu
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.15,0:31:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss Uncle Zhao.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.85,0:31:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Dou'er, my son. Don't you want to see grandmother with mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.42,0:31:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, I want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.92,0:31:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Dou'er, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.87,0:31:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.90,0:31:32.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,General Zhao!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.54,0:31:36.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,General, Lady Sun and Adou have been picked up by the men of Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.18,0:31:36.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(943.491,474.364)}Zhào Yún\NStyled: Zǐlóng
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.46,0:31:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Chase them!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.16,0:31:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lady, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.86,0:32:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.14,0:32:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lady.\NHurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.88,0:32:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.01,0:32:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lady, please hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.55,0:32:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lady, please hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.63,0:32:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lady, please hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.27,0:32:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you, daring to stop my Lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.27,0:32:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I, General Zhao Yun, am here to send my Lady off.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.71,0:32:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.62,0:33:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.39,0:33:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, chase that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.13,0:33:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.21,0:33:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.56,0:34:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.41,0:34:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry! Row!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.16,0:34:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and scull.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.66,0:34:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready the bows!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.50,0:34:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.34,0:35:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.66,0:35:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle Zhao.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.77,0:35:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhao Yun, what is this vulgarity?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.70,0:35:27.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Where is my Lady going?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.39,0:35:29.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why did you not report to the Strategos?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.54,0:35:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother is gravely ill and I had no time to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.41,0:35:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lady is returning to Wu to visit the ill, but why bring Young Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.85,0:35:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Adou is my son. Who could care for him if not me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.66,0:35:47.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My Lady, this is untrue.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.97,0:35:50.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Young Master is my Lord's one and only son.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.42,0:35:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I saved him at Changban by fighting an army with all my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.60,0:35:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my Lady wants to take him away behind my Lord's back. What reason is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.47,0:36:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.22,0:36:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You are just a warrior under the tent of the Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.66,0:36:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you mind my familial matters?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.10,0:36:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lady, you may go as you please, but you must leave the Young Master behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.42,0:36:20.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You broke into my cabin with a sharp blade in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.19,0:36:22.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You clearly intend to rebel.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.80,0:36:24.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If the Young Master is not let go,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.72,0:36:28.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,even if I were struck by a thousand cuts, I will not let my Lady go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.44,0:36:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone!\NHere.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.22,0:36:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-Take him out of the cabin.\N-Yes, madam!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.31,0:36:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you! Bring the child back! Bring him back!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.06,0:36:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt Adou!\NHurry and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.57,0:37:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Keep on sculling!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.16,0:37:06.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,When we reach the shore, let's see what Zhao Yun can do then.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.45,0:37:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.23,0:37:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, those are Liu Xuande's boats.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.70,0:37:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare for battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.75,0:37:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos' orders: Sister-in-law, please leave my nephew here!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.85,0:37:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Panic not, Zilong. Zhang Fei is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.42,0:37:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yide.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.14,0:38:01.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(927.636,468.878)}Zhāng Fēi\NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.46,0:38:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yide!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.38,0:38:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yide!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.26,0:38:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not hurt Adou!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.58,0:38:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see if they have the nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.71,0:38:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister-in-law, leave my nephew!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.16,0:38:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother-in-law, why this boorishness?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.34,0:38:43.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It is Sister-in-law's not putting my elder brother first, and going back home in secret that is boorish!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.07,0:38:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother is gravely ill. How can I not go to visit her?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.18,0:38:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, Sister-in-law must remember Elder Brother's instructions,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.68,0:38:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,to report to the Strategos before going. Why leave without doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.92,0:39:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If Third Brother-in-law does not let me go, I have only death.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.24,0:39:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.16,0:39:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-Stand down!\N-Yes, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.33,0:39:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.96,0:39:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yide, I do not wish to drive Mistress to her death either.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.54,0:39:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.34,0:39:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister-in-law, If you insist on leaving, how can I force you to stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.75,0:39:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother is Imperial Uncle of the Han, he has not mistreated Sister-in-Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.68,0:39:34.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sister-in-law, if you still think of my elder brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.28,0:39:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,you should return soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.72,0:39:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.10,0:39:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, come back soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.04,0:40:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.78,0:40:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Dou'er, my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.14,0:40:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.44,0:40:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos is smart, he has thought ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.30,0:40:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos! Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.61,0:40:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Be careful.\N-Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.00,0:40:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.29,0:40:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong, though it is unlike the slope of Changban,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.56,0:40:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,the danger of this situation and General's prowess are no lesser!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.48,0:41:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lady, when will we go back to Jing Province?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.59,0:41:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Sun found out that it was a plot only after returning to Eastern Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.03,0:41:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,From that point on, Lady Sun stayed in Eastern Wu,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.93,0:41:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,without ever seeing Liu Bei again.

